\code{nuts_params()} and \code{log_posterior()} return the sampler's own
quantities.
\code{bayes_R2()} is the Bayesian R^2 of Gelman et al. (2019).
\code{ndraws()}, \code{nchains()}, \code{niterations()} and \code{nvariables()} count
the posterior.
